VarsMinusModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Set difference of variable lists (vars without params) — names of locals that are not parameters.
    Provides: VarsMinus(vars, params) -> out. vars/params — name lists; returns vars minus params (no duplicates).
    DependsOn: InList.
    Composition: Native Include from modules/GenWasm/GenWasm.sir (Path: ../VarsMinus/VarsMinus.sir).
    Notes: result length = function local count (passed to EmitFuncBody for local declarations).
